        "en": "I came out for a walk, combining it with exercise.",
        "ko": "운동할 겸 산책하러 나왔어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "I visited to see them and also to give a gift.",
        "ko": "선물도 줄 겸 만나러 왔어요."
      },
      {
        "an": "x",
        "en": "I studied, combining it with relaxation.",
        "ko": "쉴 겸 공부도 했어요."
